# game/data/world_romance/nijah/scr_secondpreg.rpy:10
translate fr preg_Nijah_secondPreg_530a0797:

    # "Nijah took my hand and placed it over her belly, where once again I could feel the swelling life and power coursing inside of her."
    "Nijah prit ma main et la plaça sur son ventre, où une fois de plus je pus sentir la vie et le pouvoir gonfler et courir en elle."

# game/data/world_romance/nijah/scr_secondpreg.rpy:11
translate fr preg_Nijah_secondPreg_c9ecd207:

    # NIJAH "Are you pleased, master?"
    NIJAH "Es-tu satisfait, maître ?"

# game/data/world_romance/nijah/scr_secondpreg.rpy:12
translate fr preg_Nijah_secondPreg_43ba64e3:

    # MC @ smile "Very much so, Nijah."
    MC @ smile "Beaucoup, Nijah."

# game/data/world_romance/nijah/scr_secondpreg.rpy:13
translate fr preg_Nijah_secondPreg_f2c2b4bc:

    # NIJAH @ smile "I have missed you much, come... Let me serve you food."
    NIJAH @ smile "Tu m'as beaucoup manqué, viens... Laisse-moi te servir à manger."

# game/data/world_romance/nijah/scr_secondpreg.rpy:14
translate fr preg_Nijah_secondPreg_0ff7edaf:

    # NIJAH @ smile "Iz good our children will have lots of brothers and sisters!"
    NIJAH @ smile "C'est bien que nos enfants auront plein de frères et sœurs !"

# game/data/world_romance/nijah/scr_secondpreg.rpy:16
translate fr preg_Nijah_secondPreg_9053ae27:

    # "Nijah did her best to chat away with me as she cooked and served me some food."
    "Nijah fit de son mieux pour bavarder gaiement avec moi tout en cuisinant et en me servant à manger."

# game/data/world_romance/nijah/scr_secondpreg.rpy:17
translate fr preg_Nijah_secondPreg_3ad40bab:

    # "Her Alderian was still broken, but she did her best to learn and was constantly moving between rooms, attending to our already born children and devoting lavishly on me."
    "Son alderien était encore approximatif, mais elle faisait de son mieux pour apprendre et passait constamment d'une pièce à l'autre, s'occupant de nos enfants déjà nés et me couvrant de ses attentions."

# game/data/world_romance/nijah/scr_secondpreg.rpy:18
translate fr preg_Nijah_secondPreg_2500c393:

    # "Finally, with a kiss goodbye and a squeeze of her round ass, I was off once again, assuring Nijah I would return."
    "Finalement, avec un baiser d'adieu et une pression sur son cul rond, je repartis une fois de plus, assurant à Nijah que je reviendrais."

